<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Documentation on Apache HugeGraph</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/</link><description>Recent content in Documentation on Apache HugeGraph</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:09:06 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Download Apache HugeGraph</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/download/download/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/download/download/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Instructions:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;It is recommended to use the latest version of the HugeGraph software package. Please select Java11 for the runtime environment.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;To verify downloads, use the corresponding hash (SHA512), signature, and &lt;a href="https://downloads.apache.org/hugegraph/KEYS"&gt;Project Signature Verification KEYS&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Instructions for checking hash (SHA512) and signatures are on the &lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/contribution-guidelines/validate-release/"&gt;Validate Release&lt;/a&gt; page, and you can also refer to &lt;a href="https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.cgi#verify"&gt;ASF official instructions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Note: The version numbers of all components of HugeGraph have been kept consistent, and the version numbers of Maven repositories such as &lt;code&gt;client/loader/hubble/common&lt;/code&gt; are the same. You can refer to these for dependency references &lt;a href="https://github.com/apache/hugegraph-toolchain#maven-dependencies"&gt;maven example&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;Compatibility note: after HugeGraph graduated in January 2026, download paths moved from &lt;code&gt;/incubator/hugegraph&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;/hugegraph&lt;/code&gt;. Historical release file names may still include &lt;code&gt;-incubating-&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;To build from source, refer to &lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/quickstart/hugegraph/hugegraph-server/"&gt;build from source&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="latest-version"&gt;Latest Version&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;section class="hg-asf-release" id="hg-dl-1-7-0"&gt;&#10; &lt;ul class="hg-asf-release__meta"&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version:&lt;/strong&gt; 1.7.0&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Release Date:&lt;/strong&gt; 2025-11-28&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/docs/changelog/hugegraph-1.7.0-release-notes/"&gt;Release Notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10; &lt;/ul&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="td-asset-list td-asset-list--static hg-asf-release__assets"&gt;&#10; &lt;div class="td-asset-list__table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" data-td-asset-table-scroll&#10; aria-label="Download asset · Apache HugeGraph 1.7.0"&gt;&#10; &lt;table class="td-asset-list__table"&gt;&#10; &lt;caption class="visually-hidden"&gt;Download asset · Apache HugeGraph 1.7.0&lt;/caption&gt;&#10; &lt;thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Component&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;Download (ASF mirror)&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;ASC&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;th scope="col"&gt;SHA512&lt;/th&gt;&#10; &lt;/tr&gt;&#10; &lt;/thead&gt;&#10; &lt;tbody&gt;&#10; &lt;tr&gt;&#10; &lt;td&gt;Server&lt;/td&gt;&#10; &lt;td&gt;Binary&lt;/td&gt;&#10; &lt;td class="td-asset-list__file"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://www.apache.org/dyn/closer.lua/hugegraph/1.7.0/apache-hugegraph-incubating-1.7.0.tar.gz?action=download" dir="auto"&#10; aria-label="Download asset: apache-